From 5aeed4d18a5e9910e99a71b005e2e363676b7946 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 14:56:19 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add support for the Airoha EN7580 SoC and XGZ030 board

- Introduce machine directory and basic board configuration
- Add device tree for XGZ030
- Add Binman support and DDR calibration build script
- Move DDR calibration from prebuilt blobs to reconstructed source
- Update EcoNet machine infrastructure to support EN7580

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
